# Keyboard layout, in the format keyboard-configuration would write. Nothing
# on the device reads it but flutter-pi, which loads it for its xkb keymap and
# logs an error for every value it cannot find (all four are required, quoted).
# There is no keyboard on the Y2; this only keeps the log clean and gives a
# plugged-in USB one a sane default.
XKBMODEL="pc105"
XKBLAYOUT="us"
XKBVARIANT=""
XKBOPTIONS=""
